@api = http://localhost:5080

# Vulnerable-stage checks: only the local Development API with artificial seed.
# Save actual responses for CP-02/S-01 before restoring the fixed search.

### A — ordinary search: one USB seed record
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=USB

### B — absent term: []
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=zz-no-match

### C — the single permitted read-only control input: expanded result before the fix
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=zz-no-match%27%20OR%20TRUE%20--%20

### D — legitimate apostrophe: safe 500 Problem Details before the fix
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien

### T-02 — invalid numeric severity: 400 Problem Details
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "LR02-invalid-severity",
  "description": "Штучний запис для перевірки DTO.",
  "severity": "7",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### T-06 — missing incident: 404 Problem Details
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
